st take care of her. The sole bright spot is that of the Festival of Stars, where he hopes to run into Campanella, his only friend. When they finally meet up, however, it isn't while looking up at the stars, but rather traveling amongst them... as the Galactic Railroad whisks the two away for parts unknown!\n\n(Source: Discotek)"},"tags":[{"name":"Afterlife","rank":94,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Trains","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classic Literature","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Animal Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Astronomy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":75,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Religion","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":67,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosmic Horror","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":30,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Night on the Galactic Railroad","english":"Night on the Galactic Railroad","native":"銀河鉄道の夜","romaji":"Ginga Tetsudou no Yoru","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"银河铁道之夜"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}